[
  {"text":"你什麼時候打開叫車 App？","startMs":0,"endMs":3770,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"通常是已決定目的地。但如果還沒想好去哪，","startMs":3770,"endMs":8400,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"yoxi 就能先給你一點出門靈感呢？","startMs":8400,"endMs":13830,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"下班或週末想找活動，資訊散落不同平台。","startMs":13830,"endMs":17970,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"看到喜歡的，還要確認時間、地點和交通，","startMs":17970,"endMs":20370,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"最後重新輸入目的地。","startMs":20370,"endMs":23470,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"「想去」，常停在出發前。","startMs":23470,"endMs":26770,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"我們提出「yoxi 今日靈感」，用可信的近期活動，","startMs":26770,"endMs":32130,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"讓使用者依城市、日期和興趣探索。","startMs":32130,"endMs":39510,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"活動卡標示來源、更新時間和活動資訊，幫你找出今天或週末值得去的地方。","startMs":39510,"endMs":46060,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"進入詳情，可查看已核對的地點、時間與交通資訊，","startMs":46060,"endMs":49930,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"也能先收藏。決定出發，按「前往叫車」帶入目的地；","startMs":49930,"endMs":54720,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"上車點、車種和實際價格，仍由使用者確認。","startMs":54720,"endMs":59310,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"回訪，也需要理由。每天領「今日碎片」；","startMs":59310,"endMs":63590,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"走訪公開景點或活動區域，得到「探索印記」；","startMs":63590,"endMs":66960,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"完成合格訂單，累積「路線碎片」。","startMs":66960,"endMs":71290,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"集滿六片或九片，收藏一張個人化城市卡。","startMs":71290,"endMs":75020,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"分享由自己決定，不靠分享換折扣。","startMs":75020,"endMs":78450,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"AI 不是憑空推薦。提案從官方公開活動資料開始，","startMs":78450,"endMs":81400,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"檢查來源、時間、地點與狀態；","startMs":81400,"endMs":84660,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"不規則文字才交給模型擷取，再經規則和人工抽查。","startMs":84660,"endMs":89820,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"推薦理由只用核實資訊，不補寫未知票價或時間。","startMs":89820,"endMs":94840,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"市場上已有活動搜尋，也有叫車服務。","startMs":94840,"endMs":98830,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"我們要驗證的是：把發現活動、判斷可達性，","startMs":98830,"endMs":103090,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"規劃叫車串成同一段旅程；","startMs":103090,"endMs":105660,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"再用收藏為主、補貼為輔的拼圖，支持下次回訪。","startMs":105660,"endMs":110630,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"我們不只看點擊。主要指標是二十八天內，","startMs":110630,"endMs":114880,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"每千名符合資格使用者，增加多少活動相關完成訂單。","startMs":114880,"endMs":119880,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"城市試點採隨機對照，並檢查全站訂單，","startMs":119880,"endMs":124990,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"資訊錯誤、叫車失敗和新增成本，避免誤算成長。","startMs":124990,"endMs":129010,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"落地分四步：先查資料品質、訪談使用者，","startMs":129010,"endMs":133720,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"再測試介面與拼圖偏好；","startMs":133720,"endMs":136250,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"確認叫車、歸因、隱私和風控串接後，才選擇條件足夠的城市試點。","startMs":136250,"endMs":143100,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"資料及圖片授權也必須先核定。","startMs":143100,"endMs":146400,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"「今日靈感」尚未上線，但值得驗證：","startMs":146400,"endMs":149910,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"讓 yoxi 提前走進人們決定去哪的那一刻。","startMs":149910,"endMs":153660,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},
  {"text":"找到想去的地方，也更容易真的出發。","startMs":153660,"endMs":157100,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}
]
